  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cotton Small Farm Development Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Desarrollo Pequea Finca Algodonera</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PRINCIPAL OBJECTIVE OF THE PROGRAM IS TO INCREASE THE INCOME OF SMALL COTTON PRODUCERS THROUGH THE EXECUTION OF THE FOLLOWING COMPONENTS: 1. INSTALLATION OF A INSPECTION NETWORK AND MONITORING SYSTEM OF COTTON PESTS; 2. TECHNICAL ASSISTANCE FOR SMALL COTTON PRODUCERS; 3. TRAINING IN INTEGRATED FARM MANAGEMENT TECHNIQUES; AND, 4. IMPROVEMENTS IN COTTON SEED QUALITY.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
